cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this project, please cite it as below."
title: "Agentic RAG Knowledge Assistant"
abstract: >-
  A retrieval-augmented assistant where an agent plans its own tool calls over
  hybrid BM25 and vector retrieval with optional cross-encoder reranking, a
  knowledge graph, web search, a structured catalog, and read-only text-to-SQL,
  streams a cited answer, and verifies every claim against its sources.
